# Custom proxy rules (Mihomo classical / text; omit target policy)
# Keep at least one active entry to avoid empty-ruleset errors.
#
# Examples:
#   DOMAIN,exact.example.com
#   DOMAIN-SUFFIX,example.com
#   DOMAIN-KEYWORD,openai
#   IP-CIDR,1.1.1.1/32,no-resolve
#   IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1111/128,no-resolve
#   PROCESS-NAME,app.exe
#   DST-PORT,8443

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dns.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare-dns.com

# Official Tailscale control-plane, web console & DERP TCP (UDP P2P/STUN stays Direct via tailscale.list)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tailscale.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tailscale.io
